cs, hermetic sealing products, porous material structures, and flow control solutions. The FMT segment designs, produces, and distributes positive displacement pumps, valves, small volume provers, flow meters, injectors, other fluid-handling pump modules, and systems; and provides flow monitoring and other services. The FSDP segment designs, produces, and distributes firefighting pumps, valves and controls, and rescue tools; lifting bags and other components and systems; engineered stainless steel banding and clamping devices; and precision equipment for dispensing, metering, and mixing colorants and paints. The company was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Northbrook, Illinois.","employees":8700,"website":"https://www.idexcorp.com","country":"United States","city":"Northbrook","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Eric D. Ashleman","title":"CEO, President & Director"},{"name":"Ms. Lisa M. Anderson","title":"Senior VP, General Counsel, Chief Administrative Officer & Corporate Secretary"},{"name":"Mr. Akhil  Mahendra","title":"Vice President of Corporate Development"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.04,"tpe":25.65,"ps":2.129,"pfcf":27.29,"peg":1.42,"pb":3.604,"ev_ebitda":14.61,"rev_growth":0.119,"eps_growth":0.1745,"eps_growth_fwd":0.156,"eps_growth_next":0.1437,"div_yield":0.007,"roe":0.1435,"roa":0.05694,"de":67.83,"gross_margin":0.319,"op_margin":0.1176,"profit_margin":0.0714,"current_ratio":1.724},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":24.13,"sector":18.04,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":32.95,"sector":25.65,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":4.763,"sector":2.129,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":29.82,"sector":27.29,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":1.71,"sector":1.42,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":4.353,"sector":3.604,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":44.3,"sector":67.83,"verdict":"Low de